partcad-repo-ikea
=================

This PartCAD package quotes IKEA articles at a local IKEA store, and serves
IKEA products as PartCAD parts, each an alias of a model of it in one of
PartCAD's model-site collections.

The code in this repository (the `ikea_repo.py` repository plugin, the
`ikea_store.py` provider, the PartCAD configuration, the catalog, the sample
rooms, the tools and the tests), the floor plans, the floor texture and the
rendered pictures are:

    Copyright 2026 PartCAD
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

No model is included in this repository. Models, their metadata and their files
are fetched on demand from the model sites by PartCAD's collections of them,
and remain under their own terms and licences, as each model states them.
Prices and stock are read from ikea.com when a quote is asked for, subject to
IKEA's terms of use.

